<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9009" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">col-lā^crĭmo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conl-</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-lacrŭmo</span></b> ), āvi,
		1, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i>, <i>to weep together</i> or
				<i>very much</i>, <i>to bewail</i>,
				<i>deplore</i> (rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>: simul omnes collacrumarunt, Plaut. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Gell.
				1, 24, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. And. 1, 1, 82</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conplexus me senex collacrimavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rep. 6, 9, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collacrimantes suum patriaeque casum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					26, 14, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">histrio casum suum toties collacrimavit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Sest. 58, 123</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
